---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Compassio — Affluenza"
  description="A piece created in memory of LittleMan.">
  <main class="site-container">

  <article class="artwork">

    <header class="artwork-header">
      <p class="section-label">Visual Art</p>
      <h1>Compassio</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="artwork-introduction">
      <div class="reading-width">
        <p>
          This piece was created in memory of my boy, LittleMan. He and I had a
          wonderful 17 years together, and he was always so loving—unconditional
          love. Something that is very important to me is the compassion we shared.
        </p>

        <p>
          In the beginning of my recovery, I learned about the origins of the word
          “passion.” Passion derives from the Latin word <em>passio</em>, which means
          “suffering,” “endurance,” or “bearing pain.” In Latin, the prefix
          <em>com-</em> means “with” or “together.” This is where we get the word
          “compassion.”
        </p>

        <p>
          For me, compassion means <em>to endure together</em>. LittleMan and I
          endured a lot together. He was my rock.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="artwork-version artwork-original">
        <div class="artwork-version-text">
    <p>
      I originally created this piece as a wallpaper to fit the screen of my
      iPhone 15.
    </p>
  </div>

  <a
    class="artwork-image"
    href="/images/visual-art/compassio/compassio-iphone15-wallpaper.jpg"
    aria-label="View the original Compassio artwork fullscreen"
  >
    <img
      src="/images/visual-art/compassio/compassio-iphone15-wallpaper.jpg"
      alt="Compassio artwork created in memory of LittleMan"
    />
  </a>
    </section>

    <section class="artwork-version artwork-version--reverse">

  <a
    class="artwork-image"
    href="/images/visual-art/compassio/compassio-no-hidden-quote.jpg"
    aria-label="View this version of Compassio fullscreen"
  >
    <img
      src="/images/visual-art/compassio/compassio-no-hidden-quote.jpg"
      alt="Compassio without the iPhone camera island treatment"
    />
  </a>

  <div class="artwork-version-text">
    <p>
      During my exploration, I discovered that the piece can stand alone as
      three separate versions.
    </p>

    <p>
      This version removes the portion at the top that goes around the camera
      island of the iPhone screen.
    </p>
  </div>

</section>

<section class="artwork-version">

  <div class="artwork-version-text">
    <p>
      I think this one is the most personal for me. I understand all of it
      without the additional graphics.
    </p>
  </div>

  <a
    class="artwork-image"
    href="/images/visual-art/compassio/compassio-littleman.jpg"
    aria-label="View the final version of Compassio fullscreen"
  >
    <img
      src="/images/visual-art/compassio/compassio-littleman.jpg"
      alt="Compassio without the additional graphics"
    />
  </a>

    </section>
  </article>

  <dialog class="lightbox" id="artwork-lightbox">
  <button
    class="lightbox-close"
    type="button"
    aria-label="Close fullscreen image"
  >
    ×
  </button>

  <img
    class="lightbox-image"
    src=""
    alt=""
  />
</dialog>

</main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .artwork {
  padding-top: 8rem;
  padding-bottom: 0rem;
}

.artwork-header {
  margin-bottom: 5rem;
}

.section-label {
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  color: var(--colour-accent);
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
}

.artwork-introduction {
  margin-bottom: clamp(1.5rem, 10vh, 8rem);
}

.artwork-version {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
  align-items: end;
  margin-top:0;
  margin-bottom: 10rem;
}

.artwork-version-text {
  max-width: 24rem;
  justify-self: end;
  text-align: right;
  font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.5vw, 1.3rem);
  text-wrap: pretty;
}

.artwork-image {
  display: block;
  justify-self: start;
}

.artwork-image:focus {
  outline: none;
}

.artwork-image:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--colour-accent);
  outline-offset: 0.5rem;
}

.artwork-image img {
  display: block;
  width: auto;
  max-width: 100%;
  height: min(90vh, 60rem);
  object-fit: contain;
  outline: 2px solid var(--colour-accent);
  outline-offset: 0.5rem;
}

.artwork-version--reverse .artwork-image {
  justify-self: end;
}

.artwork-version--reverse .artwork-version-text {
  justify-self: start;
  text-align: left;
}

.lightbox {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;

  width: 100vw;
  max-width: none;
  height: 100vh;
  max-height: none;

  margin: 0;
  padding: 3rem;
  border: 0;
  background: rgba(57, 57, 59, 0.98);
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.lightbox[open] {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
}

.lightbox-image {
  display: block;
  width: auto;
  height: auto;
  max-width: calc(100vw - 6rem);
  max-height: calc(100vh - 6rem);
  object-fit: contain;
}

.lightbox-close {
  position: absolute;
  top: 1.5rem;
  right: 1.5rem;

  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  appearance: none;

  color: var(--colour-background);
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1;

  cursor: pointer;
}

.lightbox-close:hover {
  opacity: 0.6;
}

.lightbox-close:focus {
  outline: none;
}

.lightbox-close:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--colour-background);
  outline-offset: 0.35rem;
}

@media (max-width: 48rem) {
  .artwork {
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 0rem;
  }

  .artwork-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
   
  .artwork-introduction {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .artwork-version {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
  }

  .artwork-version:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 8rem;
  }

  .artwork-version-text {
    max-width: none;
    justify-self: stretch;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .artwork-image {
    justify-self: center;
  }

  .artwork-image img {
    width: auto;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 80vh;
  }

  .artwork-version--reverse .artwork-version-text {
    grid-row: 1;
    justify-self: stretch;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .artwork-version--reverse .artwork-image {
    grid-row: 2;
    justify-self: center;
  }

    .lightbox {
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .lightbox-image {
    max-width: calc(100vw - 3rem);
    max-height: calc(100vh - 5rem);
  }

  .lightbox-close {
    top: 0.75rem;
    right: 1rem;

    width: 2.75rem;
    height: 2.75rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
}

</style>

<script>
  const lightbox =
    document.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>("#artwork-lightbox");

  const lightboxImage =
    lightbox?.querySelector<HTMLImageElement>(".lightbox-image");

  const closeButton =
    lightbox?.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(".lightbox-close");

  const artworkLinks =
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>(".artwork-image");

  artworkLinks.forEach((link) => {
    link.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();

      const image = link.querySelector<HTMLImageElement>("img");

      if (!lightbox || !lightboxImage || !image) return;

      lightboxImage.src = link.href;
      lightboxImage.alt = image.alt;

      lightbox.showModal();
    });
  });

  closeButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    lightbox?.close();
  });

  lightbox?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
    if (event.target === lightbox) {
      lightbox.close();
    }
  });
</script>